{"segs": ["PA_ja_43:1.3"], "en": "\"Thus he lies slain,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_43:1.4"], "en": "just like the father of Veḷuka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_43:2.1"], "en": "The Third Jātaka, the Veḷuka-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
